              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tim. 5.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Waeb. 10.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngera mshahidi ungi wa tee wawuka kumshitakia mndungi wei wakosere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wandu wose wawi wichaghenda kwa wakohani na watanyi wiko kazinyi ngelo iyo, na kuwikwa imbiri ya BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watanyi wichakotia wikilola kumanya ngera uo mshahidi ni wa tee, na ikawoneka waamzighiria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "moomneka adhabu icheni ukundeghe mruna uipate; na kwa chia iyo, mchainja ugho wuwiwi aghadi konyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wandu wazima wose wichasikira na kuobua, nawo najingi ndewichaabonya wuwiwi sa ugho aghadi konyu anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msekaie na wughoma ghungi; adhabu ichakaia irangi kwa irangi, iriso kwa iriso, ighegho kwa ighegho, mkonu kwa mkonu, na kughu kwa kughu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
